{"unit_id": "gxinxing__dsh-plugin-mcp-connector#card-zh", "repo": "gxinxing/dsh-plugin-mcp-connector", "commit": "91896f048cb66fb7fc56e17d44fdf6ee2816222a", "type": "card", "lang": "zh", "text": "MCP 一站式连接器是面向 DSH Web 的 MCP 服务管理插件。它通过 Web 面板管理已配置的 MCP 服务，并将连接服务提供的工具注册到 DSH。用户可以添加、移除、启用、禁用和重启服务，支持 stdio、SSE 与 streamable HTTP 传输，也可查看工具调用日志。适合需要在 DSH Web 中接入并管理 MCP 工具的用户。服务配置保存在本机 DSH_HOME 或 HOME 目录下的 .dsh/mcp-servers.json。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["cordis.patch.yml:3-7", "lib/host/index.mjs:190-392", "lib/host/config.mjs:3-21"]}
{"unit_id": "gxinxing__dsh-plugin-mcp-connector#card-en", "repo": "gxinxing/dsh-plugin-mcp-connector", "commit": "91896f048cb66fb7fc56e17d44fdf6ee2816222a", "type": "card", "lang": "en", "text": "MCP Connector manages MCP servers in DSH Web and registers their tools with DSH. Its panel adds, removes, enables, disables, and restarts servers. It supports stdio, SSE, and streamable HTTP, and displays call logs. Configuration is stored locally in .dsh/mcp-servers.json under DSH_HOME or HOME.", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["cordis.patch.yml:3-7", "lib/host/index.mjs:190-392", "lib/host/config.mjs:3-21"]}
